            "chapter_id": "1",
            "chapter_title": "Chapter 1",
            "verse_id": "1",
            "verse_text": "Старець улюбленому Гаєві, якого я направду люблю.",
            "paragraph_number": "1",
            "teaching_id": "18839",
            "teaching_audio": "https://ttb-transcoder-final-prod.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/d539a302-bc45-4fc8-88c2-26ac07326986",
            "teaching_name": "3 Івана 1:1-3",
            "teachings_badge_image": "https://manage.churchbase.com/uploads/ttb_bible_badges/3john.jpg",
            "bible_book": "3 Івана",
            "bible_book_eng": "3 John",
            "teaching_file_name": "309555_UKR_TTB_1122_28092017_3 John_1_1_3 John_1_3_MM_.mp3",
            "folder_path": "https://ttb-content-migrations-gigster.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/TAM_TTB-Tamil+BI/309555_UKR_TTB_1122_28092017_3 John_1_1_3 John_1_3_MM_.mp3",
            "teaching_start_point": "0101",
            "teaching_end_point": "0103"
          },
          {
            "book_name": "3 John",
            "book_id": "3 John",
            "book_order": "",
            "chapter_id": "1",
            "chapter_title": "Chapter 1",
            "verse_id": "2",
            "verse_text": "Улюблений, я молюся, щоб добре велося в усьому тобі, і щоб був ти здоровий, як добре ведеться душі твоїй.",
            "paragraph_number": "2",
            "teaching_id": "18839",
            "teaching_audio": "https://ttb-transcoder-final-prod.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/d539a302-bc45-4fc8-88c2-26ac07326986",
            "teaching_name": "3 Івана 1:1-3",
            "teachings_badge_image": "https://manage.churchbase.com/uploads/ttb_bible_badges/3john.jpg",
            "bible_book": "3 Івана",
            "bible_book_eng": "3 John",
            "teaching_file_name": "309555_UKR_TTB_1122_28092017_3 John_1_1_3 John_1_3_MM_.mp3",
            "folder_path": "https://ttb-content-migrations-gigster.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/TAM_TTB-Tamil+BI/309555_UKR_TTB_1122_28092017_3 John_1_1_3 John_1_3_MM_.mp3",
            "teaching_start_point": "0101",
            "teaching_end_point": "0103"
          },
          {
            "book_name": "3 John",
            "book_id": "3 John",
            "book_order": "",
            "chapter_id": "1",
            "chapter_title": "Chapter 1",
            "verse_id": "3",
            "verse_text": "Бо я дуже зрадів, як прийшли були браття, і засвідчили правду твою, як ти живеш у правді.",
            "paragraph_number": "3",
            "teaching_id": "18839",
            "teaching_audio": "https://ttb-transcoder-final-prod.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/d539a302-bc45-4fc8-88c2-26ac07326986",
            "teaching_name": "3 Івана 1:1-3",
            "teachings_badge_image": "https://manage.churchbase.com/uploads/ttb_bible_badges/3john.jpg",
            "bible_book": "3 Івана",
            "bible_book_eng": "3 John",
            "teaching_file_name": "309555_UKR_TTB_1122_28092017_3 John_1_1_3 John_1_3_MM_.mp3",
            "folder_path": "https://ttb-content-migrations-gigster.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/TAM_TTB-Tamil+BI/309555_UKR_TTB_1122_28092017_3 John_1_1_3 John_1_3_MM_.mp3",
            "teaching_start_point": "0101",
            "teaching_end_point": "0103"
          },
          {
            "book_name": "3 John",
            "book_id": "3 John",
            "book_order": "",
            "chapter_id": "1",
            "chapter_title": "Chapter 1",
            "verse_id": "4",
            "verse_text": "Я не маю більшої радости від цієї, щоб чути, що діти мої живуть у правді.",
            "paragraph_number": "4",
            "teaching_id": "18840",
            "teaching_audio": "https://ttb-transcoder-final-prod.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/3874378b-dc53-4c0b-9cd3-5fe9b1b31c76",
            "teaching_name": "3 Івана 1:4-9",
            "teachings_badge_image": "https://manage.churchbase.com/uploads/ttb_bible_badges/3john.jpg",
            "bible_book": "3 Івана",
            "bible_book_eng": "3 John",
            "teaching_file_name": "309556_UKR_TTB_1123_29092017_3 John_1_4_3 John_1_9_MM_.mp3",
            "folder_path": "https://ttb-content-migrations-gigster.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/TAM_TTB-Tamil+BI/309556_UKR_TTB_1123_29092017_3 John_1_4_3 John_1_9_MM_.mp3",
            "teaching_start_point": "0104",
            "teaching_end_point": "0109"
          },
          {
            "book_name": "3 John",
            "book_id": "3 John",
            "book_order": "",
            "chapter_id": "1",
            "chapter_title": "Chapter 1",
            "verse_id": "5",
            "verse_text": "Улюблений, вірно ти чиниш, як що робиш для братті та для чужинців,",
            "paragraph_number": "5",
            "teaching_id": "18840",
            "teaching_audio": "https://ttb-transcoder-final-prod.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/3874378b-dc53-4c0b-9cd3-5fe9b1b31c76",
            "teaching_name": "3 Івана 1:4-9",
            "teachings_badge_image": "https://manage.churchbase.com/uploads/ttb_bible_badges/3john.jpg",
            "bible_book": "3 Івана",
            "bible_book_eng": "3 John",
            "teaching_file_name": "309556_UKR_TTB_1123_29092017_3 John_1_4_3 John_1_9_MM_.mp3",
            "folder_path": "https://ttb-content-migrations-gigster.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/TAM_TTB-Tamil+BI/309556_UKR_TTB_1123_29092017_3 John_1_4_3 John_1_9_MM_.mp3",
            "teaching_start_point": "0104",
            "teaching_end_point": "0109"
          },
          {
            "book_name": "3 John",
            "book_id": "3 John",
            "book_order": "",
            "chapter_id": "1",
            "chapter_title": "Chapter 1",
            "verse_id": "6",
            "verse_text": "вони про любов твою свідчили Церкві; добре ти зробиш, як їх випровадиш, як достойно для Бога,",
            "paragraph_number": "6",
            "teaching_id": "18840",
            "teaching_audio": "https://ttb-transcoder-final-prod.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/3874378b-dc53-4c0b-9cd3-5fe9b1b31c76",
            "teaching_name": "3 Івана 1:4-9",
            "teachings_badge_image": "https://manage.churchbase.com/uploads/ttb_bible_badges/3john.jpg",
            "bible_book": "3 Івана",
            "bible_book_eng": "3 John",
            "teaching_file_name": "309556_UKR_TTB_1123_29092017_3 John_1_4_3 John_1_9_MM_.mp3",
            "folder_path": "https://ttb-content-migrations-gigster.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/TAM_TTB-Tamil+BI/309556_UKR_TTB_1123_29092017_3 John_1_4_3 John_1_9_MM_.mp3",
            "teaching_start_point": "0104",
            "teaching_end_point": "0109"
          },
          {
            "book_name": "3 John",
            "book_id": "3 John",
            "book_order": "",
            "chapter_id": "1",
            "chapter_title": "Chapter 1",
            "verse_id": "7",
            "verse_text": "бо вийшли вони ради Ймення Його, нічого не взявши від поган.",
            "paragraph_number": "7",
            "teaching_id": "18840",
            "teaching_audio": "https://ttb-transcoder-final-prod.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/3874378b-dc53-4c0b-9cd3-5fe9b1b31c76",
            "teaching_name": "3 Івана 1:4-9",
            "teachings_badge_image": "https://manage.churchbase.com/uploads/ttb_bible_badges/3john.jpg",
            "bible_book": "3 Івана",
            "bible_book_eng": "3 John",
            "teaching_file_name": "309556_UKR_TTB_1123_29092017_3 John_1_4_3 John_1_9_MM_.mp3",
            "folder_path": "https://ttb-content-migrations-gigster.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/TAM_TTB-Tamil+BI/309556_UKR_TTB_1123_29092017_3 John_1_4_3 John_1_9_MM_.mp3",
            "teaching_start_point": "0104",
            "teaching_end_point": "0109"
          },
          {
            "book_name": "3 John",
            "book_id": "3 John",
            "book_order": "",
            "chapter_id": "1",
            "chapter_title": "Chapter 1",
            "verse_id": "8",
            "verse_text": "Отож, ми повинні приймати таких, щоб бути співробітниками правді.",
            "paragraph_number": "8",
            "teaching_id": "18840",
            "teaching_audio": "https://ttb-transcoder-final-prod.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/3874378b-dc53-4c0b-9cd3-5fe9b1b31c76",
            "teaching_name": "3 Івана 1:4-9",
            "teachings_badge_image": "https://manage.churchbase.com/uploads/ttb_bible_badges/3john.jpg",
            "bible_book": "3 Івана",
            "bible_book_eng": "3 John",
            "teaching_file_name": "309556_UKR_TTB_1123_29092017_3 John_1_4_3 John_1_9_MM_.mp3",
            "folder_path": "https://ttb-content-migrations-gigster.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/TAM_TTB-Tamil+BI/309556_UKR_TTB_1123_29092017_3 John_1_4_3 John_1_9_MM_.mp3",
            "teaching_start_point": "0104",
            "teaching_end_point": "0109"
          },
          {
            "book_name": "3 John",
            "book_id": "3 John",
            "book_order": "",
            "chapter_id": "1",
            "chapter_title": "Chapter 1",
            "verse_id": "9",
            "verse_text": "Я до Церкви писав був, але Діотреф, що любить бути першим у них, нас не приймає.",
            "paragraph_number": "9",
            "teaching_id": "18840",
            "teaching_audio": "https://ttb-transcoder-final-prod.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/3874378b-dc53-4c0b-9cd3-5fe9b1b31c76",
            "teaching_name": "3 Івана 1:4-9",
            "teachings_badge_image": "https://manage.churchbase.com/uploads/ttb_bible_badges/3john.jpg",
            "bible_book": "3 Івана",
            "bible_book_eng": "3 John",
            "teaching_file_name": "309556_UKR_TTB_1123_29092017_3 John_1_4_3 John_1_9_MM_.mp3",
            "folder_path": "https://ttb-content-migrations-gigster.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/TAM_TTB-Tamil+BI/309556_UKR_TTB_1123_29092017_3 John_1_4_3 John_1_9_MM_.mp3",
            "teaching_start_point": "0104",
            "teaching_end_point": "0109"
          },
          {
            "book_name": "3 John",
            "book_id": "3 John",
            "book_order": "",
            "chapter_id": "1",
            "chapter_title": "Chapter 1",
            "verse_id": "10",
            "verse_text": "Тому то, коли я прийду, то згадаю про вчинки його, що їх робить, словами лихими обмовляючи нас. І він тим не задовольнюється, а й сам не приймає братів, і тим, що бажають приймати, боронить, і вигонить із Церкви.",
            "paragraph_number": "10",
            "teaching_id": "18841",
            "teaching_audio": "https://ttb-transcoder-final-prod.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/9b7df18b-fede-44cf-935c-4cc76e6f86a3",
            "teaching_name": "3 Івана 1:10-15",
            "teachings_badge_image": "https://manage.churchbase.com/uploads/ttb_bible_badges/3john.jpg",
            "bible_book": "3 Івана",
            "bible_book_eng": "3 John",
            "teaching_file_name": "309557_UKR_TTB_1124_02102017_3 John_1_10_3 John_1_15_MM_.mp3",
            "folder_path": "https://ttb-content-migrations-gigster.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/TAM_TTB-Tamil+BI/309557_UKR_TTB_1124_02102017_3 John_1_10_3 John_1_15_MM_.mp3",
            "teaching_start_point": "0110",
            "teaching_end_point": "0115"
          },
          {
            "book_name": "3 John",
            "book_id": "3 John",
            "book_order": "",
            "chapter_id": "1",
            "chapter_title": "Chapter 1",
            "verse_id": "11",
            "verse_text": "Улюблений, не робися подібним до лихого, а до доброго: доброчинець від Бога, а злочинець Бога не бачив.",
            "paragraph_number": "11",
            "teaching_id": "18841",
            "teaching_audio": "https://ttb-transcoder-final-prod.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/9b7df18b-fede-44cf-935c-4cc76e6f86a3",
            "teaching_name": "3 Івана 1:10-15",
            "teachings_badge_image": "https://manage.churchbase.com/uploads/ttb_bible_badges/3john.jpg",
            "bible_book": "3 Івана",
            "bible_book_eng": "3 John",
            "teaching_file_name": "309557_UKR_TTB_1124_02102017_3 John_1_10_3 John_1_15_MM_.mp3",
            "folder_path": "https://ttb-content-migrations-gigster.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/TAM_TTB-Tamil+BI/309557_UKR_TTB_1124_02102017_3 John_1_10_3 John_1_15_MM_.mp3",
            "teaching_start_point": "0110",
            "teaching_end_point": "0115"
          },
          {
            "book_name": "3 John",
            "book_id": "3 John",
            "book_order": "",
            "chapter_id": "1",
            "chapter_title": "Chapter 1",
            "verse_id": "12",
            "verse_text": "Про Димитрія свідчили всі й сама правда. І свідчимо й ми, а ви знаєте, що свідчення наше правдиве.",
            "paragraph_number": "12",
            "teaching_id": "18841",
            "teaching_audio": "https://ttb-transcoder-final-prod.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/9b7df18b-fede-44cf-935c-4cc76e6f86a3",
            "teaching_name": "3 Івана 1:10-15",
            "teachings_badge_image": "https://manage.churchbase.com/uploads/ttb_bible_badges/3john.jpg",
            "bible_book": "3 Івана",
            "bible_book_eng": "3 John",
            "teaching_file_name": "309557_UKR_TTB_1124_02102017_3 John_1_10_3 John_1_15_MM_.mp3",
            "folder_path": "https://ttb-content-migrations-gigster.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/TAM_TTB-Tamil+BI/309557_UKR_TTB_1124_02102017_3 John_1_10_3 John_1_15_MM_.mp3",
            "teaching_start_point": "0110",
            "teaching_end_point": "0115"
          },
          {
            "book_name": "3 John",
            "book_id": "3 John",
            "book_order": "",
            "chapter_id": "1",
            "chapter_title": "Chapter 1",
            "verse_id": "13",
            "verse_text": "Багато хотів я писати, та не хочу писати до тебе чорнилом та очеретинкою,",
            "paragraph_number": "13",
            "teaching_id": "18841",
            "teaching_audio": "https://ttb-transcoder-final-prod.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/9b7df18b-fede-44cf-935c-4cc76e6f86a3",
            "teaching_name": "3 Івана 1:10-15",
            "teachings_badge_image": "https://manage.churchbase.com/uploads/ttb_bible_badges/3john.jpg",
            "bible_book": "3 Івана",
            "bible_book_eng": "3 John",
            "teaching_file_name": "309557_UKR_TTB_1124_02102017_3 John_1_10_3 John_1_15_MM_.mp3",
            "folder_path": "https://ttb-content-migrations-gigster.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/TAM_TTB-Tamil+BI/309557_UKR_TTB_1124_02102017_3 John_1_10_3 John_1_15_MM_.mp3",
            "teaching_start_point": "0110",
            "teaching_end_point": "0115"
          },
          {
            "book_name": "3 John",
            "book_id": "3 John",
            "book_order": "",
            "chapter_id": "1",
            "chapter_title": "Chapter 1",
            "verse_id": "14",
            "verse_text": "але маю надію побачити тебе незабаром, і говорити устами до уст.",
            "paragraph_number": "14",
            "teaching_id": "18841",
            "teaching_audio": "https://ttb-transcoder-final-prod.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/9b7df18b-fede-44cf-935c-4cc76e6f86a3",
            "teaching_name": "3 Івана 1:10-15",
            "teachings_badge_image": "https://manage.churchbase.com/uploads/ttb_bible_badges/3john.jpg",
            "bible_book": "3 Івана",
            "bible_book_eng": "3 John",
            "teaching_file_name": "309557_UKR_TTB_1124_02102017_3 John_1_10_3 John_1_15_MM_.mp3",
            "folder_path": "https://ttb-content-migrations-gigster.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/TAM_TTB-Tamil+BI/309557_UKR_TTB_1124_02102017_3 John_1_10_3 John_1_15_MM_.mp3",
            "teaching_start_point": "0110",
            "teaching_end_point": "0115"
          },
          {
            "book_name": "3 John",
            "book_id": "3 John",
            "book_order": "",
            "chapter_id": "1",
            "chapter_title": "Chapter 1",
            "verse_id": "15",
            "verse_text": "Мир тобі! Друзі вітають тебе. Привітай друзів пойменно! Амінь.",
            "paragraph_number": "15",
            "teaching_id": "18841",
            "teaching_audio": "https://ttb-transcoder-final-prod.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/9b7df18b-fede-44cf-935c-4cc76e6f86a3",
